  <!--
    vaml_ui_tester (Windows) — the DEDICATED Sprint 11r UI-compliance tester.
    CONSUMER-APP PATTERN (ADR-021): includes ONLY the PUBLIC include roots, never
    an internal header under src/<lib>/src. Compiles its main.cpp + the SHARED
    load_file.cpp seam (single source of truth, from vaml_viewer/).
      * vaml-core public include root   : $(ProjectDir)..\src\core\include
      * vaml-vulkan public include root : $(ProjectDir)..\src\vulkan\include
      * vaml-presentation include root  : $(ProjectDir)..\src\presentation\include
      * vaml-tools public include root  : $(ProjectDir)..\src\tools\include
      * vendored Vulkan + GLFW headers  : $(ProjectDir)..\third_party\deps\{vulkan-headers,glfw}\include
      * the shared vaml_viewer seam dir  : $(ProjectDir)..\vaml_viewer (load_file.h + app.h)
    Links (x64 only, matching the repo's msvc-debug build):
      * vaml-presentation.lib + vaml-vulkan.lib + vaml-tools.lib + vaml-core.lib
        (the msvc-debug static libs; /MTd to match — avoids LNK2038 mismatch)
    S640 scaffold: takes a `.xaml` argv, loads it through the REAL path (the
    BARE Source DP resolution), exits 0/1/2. The scanner's pull/render/scan/
    compare power is S641.
  -->
